# cek_senet.bug

> Module: cek_senet (Çek / Senet Takibi) | Category: FINANCE  
> Last UI Tested: 02 June 2026

---

### B-CEK-01: KPI Cards Labels Differ from Specification

| Field | Detail |
|-------|--------|
| **Severity** | P3 — Low |
| **Status** | ⬜ **OPEN** |
| **Found** | UI testing — KPI cards on CekSenetPage use different labels than documented |
| **Bug** | The `cek_senet.func` specification describes 4 KPI cards: "Toplam Çek/Senet", "Bekleyen Tutar", "Tahsil Edilen", "Karşılıksız". The actual UI shows 3 KPI cards: "TOPLAM PORTFÖY" (total portfolio), "YAKLAŞAN VADE (7 GÜN)" (upcoming due in 7 days), "GECİKMİŞ VADELER" (overdue). No "Tahsil Edilen" or "Karşılıksız" KPI cards visible. |
| **Impact** | Minor: users get different metric insights than documented. The actual cards are useful (upcoming due, overdue) but the spec promised collected/bounced breakdown. |
| **Required Fix** | Either: 1) Update `.func` spec to match actual UI, OR 2) Add "Tahsil Edilen" and "Karşılıksız" KPI cards if the data supports it. Current cards (portfolio, upcoming, overdue) are arguably more useful for daily operations. |
| **Files to Change** | `frontend/src/pages/CekSenetPage.tsx` or `cek_senet.func` |
| **CI Gate** | `production-integrity`: verify CekSenetPage has KPI cards with expected metric labels |
